   {
    "id": "4001:33449",
    "role": "texte d’intro",
    "police": "Inter Tight Medium 18",
    "texte": "Customer support teams today handle conversations across websites, messaging apps, and social platforms. Responding quickly is critical, yet managing high volumes manually often leads to delays, missed queries, and inconsistent responses. /  / Many support teams still rely on manual replies, ticket routing, and repetitive workflows. These tasks consume valuable time and prevent teams from focusing on complex customer issues that require human attention. /  / AI-powered chatbots like Botwise transform how teams manage conversations by automatically responding to common questions, categorizing requests, and routing complex cases to human agents.",
    "couleur": "#666666",
    "align": "LEFT",
    "w": 694,
    "h": 297,
    "x": 0,
    "y": 54,
    "nb_car": 651
   },
   {
    "id": "4001:33453",
    "role": "titre de carte",
    "police": "Switzer Semibold 28",
    "texte": "Turning Conversations into Efficient Support",
    "couleur": "#333333",
    "align": "LEFT",
    "w": 694,
    "h": 34,
    "x": 0,
    "y": 0,
    "nb_car": 44
   },
   {
    "id": "4001:33454",
    "role": "texte d’intro",
    "police": "Inter Tight Medium 18",
    "texte": "• Respond instantly to common customer questions across multiple channels  • Reduce repetitive support tasks with automated AI responses  • Improve response speed while maintaining consistent communication  • Allow support teams to focus on high-value customer interactions",
    "couleur": "#666666",
    "align": "LEFT",
    "w": 694,
    "h": 108,
    "x": 0,
    "y": 54,
    "nb_car": 273
   },
   {
    "id": "4001:33455",
    "role": "texte d’intro",
    "police": "Inter Tight Medium 18",
    "texte": "Botwise captures incoming messages and analyzes them in real time. The AI understands intent, provides accurate replies, and escalates complex cases when human support is needed.",
    "couleur": "#474747",
    "align": "LEFT",
    "w": 694,
