    "nb_car": 32
   },
   {
    "id": "4001:33458",
    "role": "texte d’intro",
    "police": "Inter Tight Medium 18",
    "texte": "Why AI Chatbots Improve Customer Support",
    "couleur": "#474747",
    "align": "LEFT",
    "w": 694,
    "h": 27,
    "x": 0,
    "y": 54,
    "nb_car": 40
   },
   {
    "id": "4001:33459",
    "role": "texte d’intro",
    "police": "Inter Tight Medium 18",
    "texte": "Modern businesses receive thousands of customer messages every day. Without automation, support teams struggle to maintain quick response times while managing growing conversation volumes. /  / AI chatbots streamline this process by automatically answering common questions, guiding customers to relevant resources, and collecting useful data from interactions. /  / Automation also reduces operational costs and improves customer satisfaction by ensuring faster responses and consistent communication across all support channels. /  / With Botwise, businesses can scale support operations while maintaining a high-quality customer experience.",
